---
import Container from "../layout/Container.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../ui/Eyebrow.astro";
---
<section id="security" class="bg-surface-1/35 py-24 md:py-28"><Container><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><div><Eyebrow icon>Trust the method</Eyebrow><h2 class="mt-4 text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink-1 md:text-[52px]">Evidence before confidence.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Open source, deterministic scoring, and verifiable on-chain inputs make the boundary visible.</p><a href="https://github.com/sachncs/agent-passport/blob/master/docs/security.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-ink-1">Read security notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="grid gap-0 border-y border-line sm:grid-cols-2 sm:border-b-0"><div class="border-b border-line py-6 sm:border-r sm:pr-8"><div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-accent">01</div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-1">Observable inputs</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Activity and relationships are derived from the configured Algorand sources.</p></div><div class="border-b border-line py-6 sm:pl-8"><div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-accent">02</div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-1">Inspectable output</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Scores include component values, reasons, risk levels, and source context.</p></div><div class="py-6 sm:border-r sm:pr-8"><div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-accent">03</div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-1">Explicit limits</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Signals do not prove a human identity or guarantee future behavior.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line py-6 sm:border-t-0 sm:pl-8"><div class="font-mono text-[11px] text-accent">04</div><h3 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-1">Open by default</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Run the service yourself and inspect the algorithms, contracts, and tests.</p></div></div></div></Container></section>
